{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["studio.write"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Plan a music video or film and get its price (one approval)"},"description":"Creates or updates a film or music-video project, saves its script or storyboard, and returns a price quote without charging. Film input contains the finished script, language, cast and visualWorld. Music input contains sections, visualWorld and optional songUnderstanding. start identifies a new project; projectId identifies an existing one. A music project without a song returns state needs_song and its projectId; planning can continue on that project after its song upload. The result contains the project, saved plan and quote. Identical operationId and input retries return the same project and quote. Rendering is separate and requires the customer's approval of the quoted price.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"boosters":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Optional motion-graphics overlay pack for the finished video, film or advert: mode 'auto' (automatic captions, titles and end card), 'off' (no motion overlay), or 'custom' with optional styleId (for example glass-keynote, product-drop, bold-hook, data-and-map, kinetic-lyric) and optional add or remove overlay kinds.","properties":{"add":{"description":"Overlay layers to include on the video.","items":{"description":"One of: \"caption\", \"zoom\", \"transition\", \"flash\", \"title\", \"callout\", \"productCard\", \"priceCard\", \"lowerThird\", \"endCard\", \"background\", \"visualiser\", \"lyric\".","type":"string"},"maxItems":13,"type":"array","uniqueItems":true},"mode":{"description":"'auto' for automatic motion graphics, 'off' for none, or 'custom' (default when styleId, add or remove are given).","enum":["auto","off","custom"],"type":"string"},"remove":{"description":"Overlay layers to exclude from the chosen style.","items":{"description":"One of: \"caption\", \"zoom\", \"transition\", \"flash\", \"title\", \"callout\", \"productCard\", \"priceCard\", \"lowerThird\", \"endCard\", \"background\", \"visualiser\", \"lyric\".","type":"string"},"maxItems":13,"type":"array","uniqueItems":true},"styleId":{"description":"Motion style identifier (for example glass-keynote, product-drop, bold-hook, data-and-map, kinetic-lyric).","maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]{0,63}$","type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"film":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Film only: the finished script, language, cast and visualWorld (same fields as studio_film_script_write). expectedRevisionId may be omitted for a new film.","properties":{"cast":{"description":"Optional: artist names to cast, in slot order. Names must be the customer's own artists.","items":{"maxLength":120,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":6,"type":"array"},"expectedRevisionId":{"description":"The revisionId from studio_sections_read, or null only when no storyboard exists.","maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"type":["string","null"]},"language":{"description":"The selected Film language. The host validates its actual model capability; text is not translated.","maxLength":35,"minLength":2,"type":"string"},"script":{"description":"The finished script, exactly as written. Its language is preserved as-is.","maxLength":100000,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"visualWorld":{"description":"Board-wide visual facts. Optional characters, vehicles, locations, props and never are arrays of up to 12 non-empty strings, each at most 300 characters. Combined rendered fields are limited to 2,400 characters including labels, separators and newlines after trimming. Scene-specific costume and visual direction belong to scene text. Shape: {timeOfDay: string, light: string, setting: string, artist?: string, characters?: list of string, vehicles?: list of string, locations?: list of string, props?: list of string, never?: list o